 class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.362</span> </span>; without <span class=\"gk\">φρένας, περὶ δέ σφεας ἤλυθ' ι&gt;<span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ωή</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.261</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16.6</span> </span>; of battle, <span class=\"gk\">ὁμός' ἦλθε μάχη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.337</span> </span>; of things sent or taken, <span class=\"gk\">ὄφρα κε δῶρα ἐκ κλισίης ἔλθῃσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.191</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.120</span> </span>; so later, esp. of danger or evil, c. dat., <span class=\"gk\">εἰ πάλιν ἔλθοι τῇ Ἑλλάδι κίνδυνος ὑπὸ βαρβάρων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.5.43</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἦλθεν αὐτῷ Ζηνὸς βέλος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">360</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μηδ' ὑπ' ἀνάγκας γάμος ἔλθοι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1032</span> </span> (lyr.), cf.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">436</span> </span>; of reports, commands, etc., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">663</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.19</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖς Ἀθηναίοις ὡς ἦλθε 